# LF in every working tree, matching what git stores in the repository and what
# the wider MWSE / Blender ecosystem ships (Ashfall and Greatness7/io_scene_mw
# are LF throughout). One representation everywhere: repo, working tree,
# deployed mod folder and release archive all agree, so nothing converts at a
# boundary and a plain diff between them is meaningful.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.nif binary
*.dll binary
*.7z binary
